</style><style>.bcx .ticketing{background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.bcx .ticketing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.bcx .ticketing p{margin-bottom:0}.bcx .ticket-actions{display:grid;gap:18px}.bcx .ticket-choice{display:grid;gap:10px}.bcx .ticket-btn{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer}.bcx .ticket-choice>a{font-weight:800;text-align:center}.bcx .ticket-btn:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}@media(max-width:820px){.bcx .ticketing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style><main class="bcx macon" style="--accent:#C18CFF" id="main-content"><header class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Macon GA Halloween Bar Crawl 2026</h1><p class="lede">Macon Has Soul. Halloween Just Turned Up the Volume.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#tickets">Give Me the Macon Wristband</a><a class="btn alt" href="#route">See the route</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Macon-Halloween-Bar-Crawl-scaled-e1754326153365.webp" alt="Four costumed friends at the Macon Halloween bar crawl" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high"></div></header><div class="facts" aria-label="Event quick facts"><div class="fact"><span>Date</span><strong>Saturday, October 31</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Published time</span><strong>6 PM to Midnight</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Neighborhood</span><strong>Downtown Macon</strong></div></div><section class="ticketing" id="tickets"><div class="wrap ticketing-grid"><div><h2>Tickets without the detour.</h2><p>Choose your event and complete the secure Eventbrite checkout without leaving this page. Use the event details link when you need the latest route or check in update.</p></div><div class="ticket-actions"><div class="ticket-choice"><button class="btn ticket-btn" id="eb-macon-ga-halloween-bar-crawl-2026-1" type="button">Buy Macon tickets</button><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/macon-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Review event details</a></div></div></div></section><section class="story"><div class="wrap"><h2>Downtown Macon brings the biggest published route in this set, four complimentary shots or cocktails, and twelve named stops. This is not a warm up. It is the whole set list.</h2><p>Macon's Halloween route is the biggest lineup in this build. From 6 PM to midnight on Saturday, October 31, Boos & Booze connects 10+ Downtown Macon bars with four complimentary shots or cocktails, published food and drink specials, photographer coverage, a costume contest, map and lanyard, registration, and an official after party.</p><p>Downtown Macon gives this crawl range: retro arcade, dueling pianos, brewpubs, cocktail rooms, and live music. No group needs to conquer all twelve named stops. Start by choosing one food stop, one activity stop, and one music stop, then let the map fill in the rest.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Real Bar Crawl USA people. Real Macon energy.</h2><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Macon-cocktail-bar-crawl-ladies.webp" alt="Friends holding cocktails at a Macon Bar Crawl USA event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>Friends holding cocktails at a Macon Bar Crawl USA event</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Macon-shamrock-bar-crawl-group-1024x807.webp" alt="A large group celebrating at a Macon Bar Crawl USA event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>A large group celebrating at a Macon Bar Crawl USA event</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="value"><div class="wrap value-grid"><div><h2>Four drinks. Twelve stops. One downtown encore.</h2><p>These are the benefits Bar Crawl USA currently publishes for this event. Check the official listing before you leave.</p></div><div class="included"><div>Access to 10+ downtown bars</div><div>Four complimentary shots or cocktails</div><div>Published food and drink specials</div><div>Event photographer</div><div>Costume contest</div><div>Event map and lanyard</div><div>Registration and official after party</div></div></div></section><section class="route-sec" id="route"><div class="wrap"><h2>Cashman's opens. The Hummingbird closes.</h2><p>Save the lineup, then check the official event page on crawl day for any venue update.</p><ol class="route"><li>Cashman's Pub</li><li>Tic Toc Room</li><li>Hoops Bar & Lounge</li><li>The Daisy Tequila Bar</li><li>Reboot Retrocade & Bar</li><li>Parish on Cherry</li><li>Niche 385</li><li>Jalapenos Cantina</li><li>The Social Duck</li><li>Ocmulgee Brewpub</li><li>570 Dueling Piano Bar</li><li>The Hummingbird Stage & Taproom</li></ol></div></section><section class="night"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Your Macon night works better with one simple plan.</h2></div><div><p>Start with the official event listing, confirm the registration point, and save the route before your group leaves home. Choose two places everybody wants to see, one place to reunite if the group splits, and the official after party when one is published. That leaves enough structure to keep the night moving without turning a bar crawl into a group project.</p><p>The published window is 6 PM to Midnight in Downtown Macon. Arrive early enough to check in without rushing, eat before the route gets loud, and keep the official ticket page handy for any same day change.</p></div></div></section><section class="crew"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Build the costume for a full downtown performance.</h2><p class="crew-note">Macon is the page where a route captain really matters. Save the venue list, choose a dinner window, and do not wait until the tenth stop to decide where everyone is meeting. For costumes, lean into the city's music personality without carrying anything you will regret by midnight.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>Make the smart plan before the first round.</h3><p>Bring a valid ID, keep the ticket confirmation easy to reach, and arrange a sober ride home before check in. Parking and transit information can change.</p><p><a href="https://www.parkmacon.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find Downtown Macon parking</a></p><p class="note">External planning resource. Bar Crawl USA does not control parking, transit, or street information.</p></div></div></section><section class="faq-sec"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Macon Halloween crawl questions, answered.</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>When is the Macon Halloween bar crawl?</summary><p>Saturday, October 31, 2026 from 6 PM to midnight.</p></details><details><summary>How many bars are included?</summary><p>The event promotes 10+ bars and the current published route names twelve venues.</p></details><details><summary>How many shots are included?</summary><p>The published ticket description lists four complimentary shots or cocktails.</p></details><details><summary>Does the route include food options?</summary><p>The event advertises published food and drink specials at participating stops.</p></details><details><summary>Where should I verify the latest route?</summary><p>Use the official Bar Crawl USA event page before and during the crawl for operational updates.</p></details></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Keep the night moving.</h2><nav class="related" aria-label="Related Bar Crawl USA pages"><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/macon-bar-crawl/">Macon bar crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Boos and Booze Halloween hub</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/macon-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Official Macon event page</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/roswell-ga-halloween-bar-crawl-2026/">Roswell Halloween crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/sarasota-halloween-bar-crawl-2026/">Sarasota Halloween crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/atlanta-halloween-bar-crawls-2026/">Atlanta Halloween crawl guide</a></nav></div></section><section class="final"><div class="wrap"><h2>Macon Has Soul. Halloween Just Turned Up the Volume. Ready?</h2><a class="btn" href="#tickets">Give Me the Macon Wristband</a><p class="note">Review the official event listing for the latest operational details.</p></div></section>
