</style><style>.bcx .ticketing{background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.bcx .ticketing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.bcx .ticketing p{margin-bottom:0}.bcx .ticket-actions{display:grid;gap:18px}.bcx .ticket-choice{display:grid;gap:10px}.bcx .ticket-btn{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer}.bcx .ticket-choice>a{font-weight:800;text-align:center}.bcx .ticket-btn:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}@media(max-width:820px){.bcx .ticketing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style><main class="bcx roswell" style="--accent:#FF6FAE" id="main-content"><header class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Roswell GA Halloween Bar Crawl 2026</h1><p class="lede">Canton Street Has Unfinished Halloween Business.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#tickets">Take Me to Canton Street</a><a class="btn alt" href="#route">See the route</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Roswell-ladies-bar-crawl.webp" alt="Friends at a Bar Crawl USA event in Roswell" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high"></div></header><div class="facts" aria-label="Event quick facts"><div class="fact"><span>Date</span><strong>Saturday, October 31</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Published time</span><strong>3 PM to 10 PM</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Neighborhood</span><strong>Downtown Roswell</strong></div></div><section class="ticketing" id="tickets"><div class="wrap ticketing-grid"><div><h2>Tickets without the detour.</h2><p>Choose your event and complete the secure Eventbrite checkout without leaving this page. Use the event details link when you need the latest route or check in update.</p></div><div class="ticket-actions"><div class="ticket-choice"><button class="btn ticket-btn" id="eb-roswell-ga-halloween-bar-crawl-2026-1" type="button">Buy Roswell tickets</button><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/roswell-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl-2/">Review event details</a></div></div></div></section><section class="story"><div class="wrap"><h2>North End Kitchen handles registration. Rock N Taco owns the after party. Ten published stops turn an afternoon start into the longest costume story Historic Roswell will tell all week.</h2><p>Historic Roswell goes full Halloween on Saturday, October 31. The 3 PM to 10 PM crawl starts at North End Kitchen, moves through 6+ downtown bars, and finishes with the official after party at Rock N Taco. Tickets list two complimentary shots, drink specials, photographer coverage, a $100 costume contest, plus the event map and lanyard.</p><p>An afternoon start changes the rhythm in Roswell. Use the first hour for check in, a group photo, and food before the route gets louder. The published lineup stretches from Canton Street favorites to Gate City Brewing and the Rock N Taco finale, so it helps to decide early whether your group is optimizing for cocktails, food, beer, or the costume contest.</p></div></section><section class="route-sec" id="route"><div class="wrap"><h2>Historic bricks. Modern costumes. Very clear stops.</h2><p>Save the lineup, then check the official event page on crawl day for any venue update.</p><ol class="route"><li>North End Kitchen, registration</li><li>The Vick</li><li>Stout Brothers</li><li>Madrid Tavern</li><li>Ipp's Pastaria</li><li>Ceviche</li><li>Lola's Tequila Bar</li><li>The Artillery Room</li><li>Gate City Brewing</li><li>Rock N Taco, official after party</li></ol></div></section><section class="night"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Your Roswell night works better with one simple plan.</h2></div><div><p>Start with the official event listing, confirm the registration point, and save the route before your group leaves home. Choose two places everybody wants to see, one place to reunite if the group splits, and the official after party when one is published. That leaves enough structure to keep the night moving without turning a bar crawl into a group project.</p><p>The published window is 3 PM to 10 PM in Downtown Roswell. Arrive early enough to check in without rushing, eat before the route gets loud, and keep the official ticket page handy for any same day change.</p></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Real Bar Crawl USA people. Real Roswell energy.</h2><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Roswell-bar-crawl-group.webp" alt="A group posing together during a Roswell Bar Crawl USA event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>A group posing together during a Roswell Bar Crawl USA event</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Boos-and-Booze-Halloween-Bar-Crawl-Partygoer.webp" alt="Costumed attendee at a Bar Crawl USA Boos and Booze Halloween event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>Costumed attendee at a Bar Crawl USA Boos and Booze Halloween event</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="value"><div class="wrap value-grid"><div><h2>Two shots. Ten stops. A Rock N Taco finish.</h2><p>These are the benefits Bar Crawl USA currently publishes for this event. Check the official listing before you leave.</p></div><div class="included"><div>Access to 6+ downtown bars</div><div>Two complimentary shots</div><div>Published drink specials</div><div>Event photographer</div><div>$100 costume contest</div><div>Event map and lanyard</div><div>Rock N Taco after party</div></div></div></section><section class="crew"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Old streets reward shoes that can actually walk.</h2><p class="crew-note">Roswell's early start is ideal for coordinated group costumes because there is time to get the full photo before dark. Choose a costume that works both outside and inside, and make North End Kitchen the non negotiable check in meeting point.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>Make the smart plan before the first round.</h3><p>Bring a valid ID, keep the ticket confirmation easy to reach, and arrange a sober ride home before check in. Parking and transit information can change.</p><p><a href="https://roswelldda.com/parking" rel="noopener noreferrer">Review Downtown Roswell parking resources</a></p><p class="note">External planning resource. Bar Crawl USA does not control parking, transit, or street information.</p></div></div></section><section class="faq-sec"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Roswell Halloween crawl questions, answered.</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>When is the Roswell Halloween bar crawl?</summary><p>Saturday, October 31, 2026 from 3 PM to 10 PM.</p></details><details><summary>Where is registration?</summary><p>The published route begins with registration at North End Kitchen.</p></details><details><summary>Where is the after party?</summary><p>Rock N Taco is listed as the official after party stop.</p></details><details><summary>What is included?</summary><p>Two complimentary shots, published specials, photographer coverage, a $100 costume contest, and an event map and lanyard are listed.</p></details><details><summary>Is the route in Historic Roswell?</summary><p>The published lineup is centered in Downtown Roswell and includes several Canton Street area favorites.</p></details></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Keep the night moving.</h2><nav class="related" aria-label="Related Bar Crawl USA pages"><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/roswell-bar-crawls/">Roswell bar crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Boos and Booze Halloween hub</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/roswell-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl-2/">Official Roswell event page</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/sarasota-halloween-bar-crawl-2026/">Sarasota Halloween crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/atlanta-halloween-bar-crawls-2026/">Atlanta Halloween crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/cleveland-halloween-bar-crawls-2026/">Cleveland Halloween crawl guide</a></nav></div></section><section class="final"><div class="wrap"><h2>Canton Street Has Unfinished Halloween Business. Ready?</h2><a class="btn" href="#tickets">Take Me to Canton Street</a><p class="note">Review the official event listing for the latest operational details.</p></div></section>
