</style><style>.bcx .ticketing{background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.bcx .ticketing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.bcx .ticketing p{margin-bottom:0}.bcx .ticket-actions{display:grid;gap:18px}.bcx .ticket-choice{display:grid;gap:10px}.bcx .ticket-btn{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer}.bcx .ticket-choice>a{font-weight:800;text-align:center}.bcx .ticket-btn:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}@media(max-width:820px){.bcx .ticketing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style><main class="bcx sarasota" style="--accent:#2ED3B7" id="main-content"><header class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Sarasota Halloween Bar Crawl 2026</h1><p class="lede">The Beach Will Be There Tomorrow. Raffurty's Is Calling Now.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#tickets">Start Me at Raffurty's</a><a class="btn alt" href="#route">See the route</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Boos-and-Booze-Halloween-Bar-Crawl-Partygoer.webp" alt="Costumed attendee at a Sarasota Boos and Booze Halloween event" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high"></div></header><div class="facts" aria-label="Event quick facts"><div class="fact"><span>Date</span><strong>Saturday, October 31</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Published time</span><strong>Registration 3 PM to 6 PM</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Neighborhood</span><strong>Downtown Sarasota</strong></div></div><section class="ticketing" id="tickets"><div class="wrap ticketing-grid"><div><h2>Tickets without the detour.</h2><p>Choose your event and complete the secure Eventbrite checkout without leaving this page. Use the event details link when you need the latest route or check in update.</p></div><div class="ticket-actions"><div class="ticket-choice"><button class="btn ticket-btn" id="eb-sarasota-halloween-bar-crawl-2026-1" type="button">Buy Sarasota tickets</button><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/sarasota-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Review event details</a></div></div></div></section><section class="story"><div class="wrap"><h2>Sarasota keeps the honest schedule honest. Registration runs from 3 to 6 at Raffurty's. The published route returns there for the 10 PM after party. No invented all day window. Just the facts your group needs.</h2><p>Downtown Sarasota's Halloween crawl is confirmed for Saturday, October 31. Registration runs at Raffurty's from 3 PM to 6 PM, and the published route continues through the Raffurty's after party at 10 PM. The source does not currently state one complete event wide operating window, so this guide keeps the verified schedule pieces separate.</p><p>Sarasota's route is compact and easy to understand: check in at Raffurty's, move through Main Street area stops, then return for the 10 PM after party. The smart play is to arrive during the registration window, eat before the crowd peaks, and use Raffurty's as the group's beginning and ending anchor.</p></div></section><section class="crew"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Warm weather costume rules apply. Hydration still wins.</h2><p class="crew-note">Sarasota's warmer weather gives costumes more freedom, but the afternoon start still means sun and walking. Hydrate before check in, choose one person to hold the ticket confirmations, and use the Raffurty's return as the final meetup plan.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>Make the smart plan before the first round.</h3><p>Bring a valid ID, keep the ticket confirmation easy to reach, and arrange a sober ride home before check in. Parking and transit information can change.</p><p><a href="https://www.sarasotafl.gov/Our-City/Parking-and-Mobility" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the City of Sarasota parking and mobility guide</a></p><p class="note">External planning resource. Bar Crawl USA does not control parking, transit, or street information.</p></div></div></section><section class="route-sec" id="route"><div class="wrap"><h2>Six downtown stops with a beginning you can find.</h2><p>Save the lineup, then check the official event page on crawl day for any venue update.</p><ol class="route"><li>Raffurty's, registration 3 to 6 PM</li><li>The Office Bar</li><li>Evie's Tavern</li><li>Joe's on Main</li><li>Fat Rabbit</li><li>Raffurty's, official after party at 10 PM</li></ol></div></section><section class="night"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Your Sarasota night works better with one simple plan.</h2></div><div><p>Start with the official event listing, confirm the registration point, and save the route before your group leaves home. Choose two places everybody wants to see, one place to reunite if the group splits, and the official after party when one is published. That leaves enough structure to keep the night moving without turning a bar crawl into a group project.</p><p>The published window is Registration 3 PM to 6 PM in Downtown Sarasota. Arrive early enough to check in without rushing, eat before the route gets loud, and keep the official ticket page handy for any same day change.</p></div></div></section><section class="value"><div class="wrap value-grid"><div><h2>Raffurty's starts it. Raffurty's finishes it.</h2><p>These are the benefits Bar Crawl USA currently publishes for this event. Check the official listing before you leave.</p></div><div class="included"><div>Access to 6+ downtown bars</div><div>Two complimentary shots</div><div>Published drink specials</div><div>Event photographer</div><div>$100 costume contest</div><div>Event map and lanyard</div><div>Raffurty's after party at 10 PM</div></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Real Bar Crawl USA people. Real Sarasota energy.</h2><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/sarasota-bar-crawl-crew-scaled.webp" alt="Friends posing at a Sarasota Bar Crawl USA event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>Friends posing at a Sarasota Bar Crawl USA event</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://barcrawlusa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/friends-at-sarasota-bar-crawl-usa-event.webp" alt="A group of friends celebrating at a Sarasota Bar Crawl USA event" loading="lazy" width="900" height="700"><figcaption>A group of friends celebrating at a Sarasota Bar Crawl USA event</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="faq-sec"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Sarasota Halloween crawl questions, answered.</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>When is the Sarasota Halloween bar crawl?</summary><p>It takes place Saturday, October 31, 2026. Registration is published for 3 PM to 6 PM at Raffurty's.</p></details><details><summary>What is the full event time?</summary><p>The source does not currently publish one complete event wide window. It confirms registration from 3 PM to 6 PM and a route that reaches the Raffurty's after party at 10 PM.</p></details><details><summary>Where is registration?</summary><p>Registration is at Raffurty's.</p></details><details><summary>What is included?</summary><p>Two complimentary shots, published specials, photographer coverage, a $100 costume contest, and an event map and lanyard are listed.</p></details><details><summary>Where is the after party?</summary><p>The published route returns to Raffurty's for the official 10 PM after party.</p></details></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><h2>Keep the night moving.</h2><nav class="related" aria-label="Related Bar Crawl USA pages"><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/sarasota-bar-crawls/">Sarasota bar crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Boos and Booze Halloween hub</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/event/sarasota-boos-booze-halloween-bar-crawl/">Official Sarasota event page</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/atlanta-halloween-bar-crawls-2026/">Atlanta Halloween crawl guide</a><a href="https://barcrawlusa.com/cleveland-halloween